OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,FNo further action will be taken
OL,7,Fagainst Green Party leader Zack
OL,8,FPolanski after he shared an image on
OL,9,Fsocial media depicting a man wearing a
OL,10,Fblack T-shirt with a picture of a
OL,11,Fguillotine and the words "We're only
OL,12,Fmaking plans for Nigel", the
OL,13,FMetropolitan Police said.
OL,15,FReform UK said on Monday the party had
OL,16,Freported Mr Polanski to the police,
OL,17,Fwith leader Nigel Farage calling for
OL,18,Fhis arrest.
OL,26,@sD@ZOUtD@WO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,FOfficers reviewed the reports and
OL,7,Fdecided no further action will be
OL,8,Ftaken in relation to the sharing of
OL,9,Fthe image online, the force said.
OL,11,FIn a statement on Wednesday, the force
OL,12,Fsaid: "We must not treat individuals
OL,13,Fdifferently solely because of their
OL,14,Fpublic profile, and therefore any
OL,15,Finvestigation would need to have
OL,16,Fconsidered not just the actions of the
OL,17,Findividual named in the reports, but
OL,18,Fof all 130-plus people and
OL,19,Forganisations.
OL,26,@tD@GOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,F"Given it is unlikely their actions
OL,7,Fwould have ultimately constituted an
OL,8,Foffence, such an extensive
OL,9,Finvestigation was deemed to be
OL,10,Fdisproportionate and not a reasonable
OL,11,Fuse of police resources.
OL,13,F"Accordingly, no further action will
OL,14,Fbe taken in relation to the sharing of
OL,15,Fthe image online."
OL,17,FBut the force determined that a crime
OL,18,Fshould be recorded in relation to the
OL,19,Fwearing of the T-shirt.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUwD@RO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,FPolice said the event where that
OL,7,Foccurred took place in Bristol so the
OL,8,Fcrime report has been transferred to
OL,9,FAvon and Somerset Police.
OL,11,FNow, Avon and Somerset Police have
OL,12,Fsaid the threshold for a criminal
OL,13,Foffence has not been met and no
OL,14,Ffurther action will be taken.
OL,16,FA Reform UK spokesman criticised the
OL,17,FMetropolitan Police's decision to take
OL,18,Fno further action against Mr Polanski.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
