CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,FThe spokesman said: "Once again we see
OL,7,Fthat we are living in two-tier
OL,8,FBritain."
OL,10,FThe Metropolitan Police said their
OL,11,Freview reached the following
OL,12,Fconclusions:
OL,14,F` It is unlikely that the sharing of
OL,15,Fthe image online would constitute a
OL,16,Fcriminal offence. Officers have
OL,17,Fconsidered telecommunications, public
OL,18,Forder and other offences, including
OL,19,Fincitement, in reaching this
OL,20,Fconclusion.
OL,26,@nD@UOUpD@IO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,F` The image in question was the 18th
OL,7,Fin a post containing 20 images. The
OL,8,Fperson named on the reports received
OL,9,Fhas stated publicly, either directly
OL,10,For in statements issued on his behalf,
OL,11,Fthat he had not seen the specific
OL,12,Fimage in question when he accepted the
OL,13,Finvitation to collaborate. Steps were
OL,14,Ftaken to remove the post from his
OL,15,Faccount when the issue was raised.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,F` The post has since been shared
OL,7,F(whether by collaboration, reposting
OL,8,For sharing) by around 130 accounts.
OL,9,FThe image has additionally been shared
OL,10,Fon many more occasions on other social
OL,11,Fmedia platforms. We must not treat
OL,12,Findividuals differently solely because
OL,13,Fof their public profile, and therefore
OL,14,Fany investigation would need to have
OL,15,Fconsidered not just the actions of the
OL,16,Findividual named in the reports, but
OL,17,Fof all 130-plus people and
OL,18,Forganisations. Given it is unlikely
OL,19,Ftheir actions would have ultimately
OL,20,Fconstituted an offence, such an
OL,21,Fextensive investigation was deemed to
OL,22,Fbe disproportionate and not a
OL,23,Freasonable use of police resources.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,FA Met Police spokesperson said: "We
OL,7,Fabsolutely understand the reaction to
OL,8,Fthis image being shared online,
OL,9,Fparticularly in the context of
OL,10,Fincreasing threats towards politicians.
OL,12,F"We take the safety and security of
OL,13,Fthose in public life, including
OL,14,Fpoliticians, very seriously.
OL,16,F"Where we identify threats we take
OL,17,Fappropriate action and where there is
OL,18,Fevidence of offences we will
OL,19,Finvestigate.
OL,26,@nD@aOUtD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,F"While there will be people who will
OL,7,Fargue that those who shared the image
OL,8,Fin this Instagram post should be
OL,9,Fsubject to criminal action, our review
OL,10,Fhas concluded that on this occasion,
OL,11,Fthe threshold is not met.
OL,13,F"We have spoken with those impacted to
OL,14,Fexplain that decision making and to
OL,15,Fprovide reassurance around our ongoing
OL,16,Fcommitment to their security and the
OL,17,Fadditional support available."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUyD@^O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Avon and Somerset
OL,7,FPolice said: "We have carefully
OL,8,Fconsidered the available evidence in
OL,9,Frelation to a photograph taken at a
OL,10,Fpolitical event in Bristol and
OL,11,Fsubsequently shared on social media as
OL,12,Fpart of a gallery of 20 images.
OL,14,F"Particular consideration has been
OL,15,Fgiven to the context around the image;
OL,16,Fits use of song lyrics, and the
OL,17,Fmarketing of the T-shirt as a
OL,18,Fsatirical piece.
OL,26,@oD@NOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,F"No complaints were received from
OL,7,Fpeople at the event at which it was
OL,8,Fworn and there is no evidence the
OL,9,Fwearer of the T-shirt intended to
OL,10,Fthreaten any individual, or encourage
OL,11,Fanyone else to do so.
OL,13,F"As a result, a senior detective has
OL,14,Fdetermined that the threshold for a
OL,15,Fcriminal offence has not been met and
OL,16,Fno further action will be taken.
OL,18,F"The safety of elected politicians is
OL,19,Fsomething we take extremely seriously
OL,20,Fand we continue to take action
OL,21,Fwherever a threat is identified.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G11/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,F"The affected parties have been
OL,7,Fupdated of our decision."
OL,9,FMr Polanski faced questions about the
OL,10,Fimage when he appeared on BBC
OL,11,FNewsnight on Tuesday.
OL,13,FHe declined to apologise, saying the
OL,14,Fpost contained 20 images and he "just
OL,15,Fdidn't look carefully enough".
OL,17,FMr Polanski added: "If I'd done it
OL,18,Fdeliberately, I'd be apologising.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@YO]vD@aOUwD@]O]yD@TOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G12/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37413
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,F"But because this was a mistake, I
OL,7,Fthink the important thing is that I
OL,8,Fpoint out it's a mistake, that I also
OL,9,Fmake sure that I condemn political
OL,10,Fviolence, and also crucially, I make a
OL,11,Fcommitment to be better on my social
OL,12,Fmedia."
OL,14,FSpeaking on Wednesday before the Met
OL,15,Fsaid it was going to take no further
OL,16,Faction against Mr Polanski, Mr Farage
OL,17,Ftold reporters he wanted the force "to
OL,18,Fact".
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@GO]yD@dOUzD@DO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G13/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37414
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,FThe Reform UK leader said: "If people
OL,7,Fpost on social media things that are
OL,8,Fracist or inciteful, they nearly
OL,9,Falways get a knock at the door,
OL,10,Fcharged, and that's right and proper.
OL,12,F"If we're going to have an even field
OL,13,Fon this, then Polanski, who is in a
OL,14,Fposition of serious responsibility
OL,15,Fwith a large number of followers,
OL,16,Fcannot put out on his social media the
OL,17,Fimage that he did, my name, the
OL,18,Fguillotine, without some consequences.
OL,26,@nD@\OUtD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G14/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37415
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,F"Now look, we all get things wrong in
OL,7,Flife, we all make mistakes in life.
OL,8,FWhat we do afterwards is, we apologise.
OL,10,F"Given that he refuses to apologise, I
OL,11,Fexpect the Metropolitan Police to act."
OL,13,FA Green Party spokesperson said: "The
OL,14,Fpolice have examined the evidence and
OL,15,Fconcluded that no crime was committed."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUsD@gO]uD@bOUwD@gO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G15/16
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
