PN,37416
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785412109
OL,3,CNo further action to be taken against
OL,4,CPolanski over social media image
OL,6,FThe spokesperson said "this was
OL,7,Fobvious from the start" and claimed
OL,8,FReform UK was "always using this as a
OL,9,Fpolitical football for their own
OL,10,Fcynical purposes to distract from
OL,11,Fquestions" about how Mr Farage's party
OL,12,Fis funded.
OL,26,@nD@WOUoD@WO]pD@OOUsD@JO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G16/16
